{{also|herberge}}
==German==

===Etymology===
{{PIE root|de|ker|bʰergʰ}}
From {{inh|de|goh|heriberga}}, from {{inh|de|gem-pro|*harjabergō}}, compound of {{m|de|Heer}} and a derivation of {{m|de|bergen}}, literally "accommodation for the army". Cognate with {{cog|en|harbor}} and {{m|en|harbinger}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|De-Herberge.ogg|Audio|lang=de}}

===Noun===
{{de-noun|f||Herbergen}}

# [[hostel]], [[hospice]], [[inn]] {{gloss|lodging for travellers, usually serving breakfast and cold supper, but not necessarily hot food}}
#: {{ux|de|Unsere '''Herberge''' ist einfach aber gemütlich.|Our '''hostel''' is simple but cosy.}}
# [[home]], [[shelter]], place to [[sleep]]
#: {{ux|de|Er hat keine '''Herberge'''.|He has no '''place to sleep'''.}}

